{
  "id": "family-outing-plan",
  "title": "一起規劃出遊",
  "titleEn": "Planning a Family Outing",
  "category": "家庭生活",
  "level": "初級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/family-outing-plan.webp",
    "alt": "在溫馨明亮的客廳裡，一家人圍坐在茶几旁開心地討論出遊計畫，桌上放著筆記本、水壺與遮陽帽，大家滿懷期待地規劃登山健行行程。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "On Friday evening, Dad sits down with the family and smiles, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's plan our ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-plan-our-trip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "trip",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-plan-our-trip"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "trip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-plan-our-trip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "週五晚上，爸爸和家人一起坐下來微笑著說：「我們來規劃我們的旅行吧。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom opens a notebook and suggests visiting a scenic "
        },
        {
          "text": "mountain",
          "wordIds": [
            "mountain"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " park this weekend."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽打開筆記本，建議這個週末去一座風景優美的山區公園。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad checks his phone and says the "
        },
        {
          "text": "weather",
          "wordIds": [
            "weather"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " will be sunny and clear."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸查看手機並表示天氣將會晴朗無雲。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Emily raises her hand excitedly and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What should we ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-should-we-bring"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bring",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-should-we-bring"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "bring"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-should-we-bring"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 興奮地舉手問道：「我們應該帶什麼？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom smiles and reminds everyone, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't forget your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-hat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hat",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-hat"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "hat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-hat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽微笑著提醒大家：「別忘了你的帽子。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They also decide to pack sandwiches and water for a pleasant "
        },
        {
          "text": "picnic",
          "wordIds": [
            "picnic"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們還決定準備三明治和水，來一場愉快的外出野餐。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Looking forward to the hike, everyone cheers, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be so much fun!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-will-be-so-much-fun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "期待著即將到來的健行，大家一起歡呼：「一定會非常好玩！」"
    }
  ],
